<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104019" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῑμωρ-ητέον</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must visit with vengeance, punish</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινας</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				15.174
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				867c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμωρητέος, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
					<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <i>that ought to
				be punished</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὲρ ἁπάντων τ. ὡς κοινὸς ἐχθρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.142
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ητέον</span>
			<i>one must assist</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.168
			</span></i>: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμωρητέα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.86
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must defend</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ ἐναντίῳ λόγῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					37
				</span></i>
			.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β́</span>.</div>
